 ## Unreleased
 
+- An order may carry a `note` (delivery instructions, up to 200 characters): the receipt prints it
+  as its last line and `price-order --json` includes it.
+
 ## 0.7.0 (2026-10-04)
 
 - Refunds of some of an order's lines, with a 15% restocking fee for opened items
